{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:16 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>今日下午3時許，姜濤在圓方出席服裝品牌活動，約有400粉絲圍滿商場，他在幾名保安護航下現身，粉絲隨即尖叫，姜濤無回應，直上扶手電梯到樓上的專門店，記者趁機問他在峇里出席隊友Stanley的婚禮感受，他舉姆指和點頭示意好玩，然後即埋位拍攝，專業地擺甫士。臨步入專門店前，才回頭對在場粉絲揮手。</p>\n<h2>來賓舉機搶拍姜濤</h2>\n<p>專門店內，不少應邀出席的來賓見姜濤到場，紛紛舉機拍照，同場出席還有由經理人花姐陪同到場的姜濤師弟范卓賢（Jacky Fan），及倪晨曦、李靖筠。姜濤逗留大約45分鐘後離開，他出來時特意向圍滿商場四方八面的粉絲揮手，商場圍封了一條扶手電梯讓姜濤離開，他則一路向粉絲揮手。</p>\n<img alt=\"今日下午3時許，姜濤在圓方出席服裝品牌活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6ff006f76ed4b2486e5ab79ea1dbbca1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_26_04_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"約有400粉絲圍滿商場睇姜濤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ed6491f7288fa46c9c1caaf7e2787174/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_25_37_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"倪晨曦\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2972d599ccb1d4e1225a8080787e2111/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_25_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"場面大陣仗！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/667eef7e649c3b6e94175d713f2da5ea/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_25_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲一見姜濤行過即尖叫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4f96388944ea808e0b90b03be435391e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_25_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤不斷揮手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/35a636c53da8d8a01b5482daaf0bb294/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_25_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"來賓勁影姜濤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6abef4133f270fb6119378b342bca03e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_25_44_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤吸金力強。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d6b3c01cb043bd3cc29b31c30518c2e1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_26_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李靖筠\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8d268ffd263be4b2bb8a1fe4f6e94453/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_26_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"范卓賢\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/363cedb155f7d8bea4e1cbb22d6a09b7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_17_26_16.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:41.108279+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:16:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:38.447501+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:41.361755+00:00","content_hash":"68b2e0b8ce09d03ba9708dbddab9cf0bec98066cbe31c9ea69714ed7766dc954","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}